  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Game::Game.Dialogue.TextDialogueNode
  text: 'Cut, haul, stack. The blocks go up the hoists to the fort, and every one of them is counted. Meet your tally and you eat. Miss it and you owe, and I don''t forget a debt any more than Voss does.'
